  "judge": {
    "dimensions": [
      {
        "name": "Exposure",
        "score": 7,
        "rationale": "The address is read from the event payload with jq and never appears in the `run:` text, and it is masked with `::add-mask::` before any later use, so the script's 'Sending report to' line should show as ***. It loses points because masking depends on the script's output being masked, the workflow itself does not stop the script from printing the address, and the run's input box is still visible in the UI."
      },
      {
        "name": "Workflow",
        "score": 8,
        "rationale": "It has a manual `workflow_dispatch` trigger with a required email input, top-level `contents: read` permissions, and the only `uses:` (actions/checkout) pinned to a full 40-character SHA. It loses points because actionlint was not run, so the YAML was only checked for parsing, and the step was never run against a real dispatch."
      },
      {
        "name": "Restraint",
